                "text": "根据信息，如果您的非驾驶员身份证丢失、损毁或地址变更，可以申请更换。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Replace a non-driver ID card#1_0::c0001"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states that if the ID is lost, damaged, or address updated, it can be replaced."
              },
              {
                "text": "但如果证件已过期，则无法更换，您必须续期或申请新证。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Replace a non-driver ID card#1_0::c0001"
                ],
                "reason": "The context explicitly says expired IDs cannot be replaced and must be renewed or new application."
              },
              {
                "text": "另外，如果您即将年满21岁，建议在生日后40天内下单，以获得不带“UNDER 21”标识的身份证。",
